Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 21:07:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 176/209] feat(area): AreaComponents engine plugin +
 AreaComponentsEditor skeletons (stage 0.4)

Adds the two modules the Area modernisation lives in, compiling 0/0 but doing nothing yet:

- Code/CryPlugins/AreaComponents: engine plugin registering a Schematyc env package "AreaComponents".
  Interface/IShapeComponent.h is the shape contract from decision 01: EShapeKind, EShapeChangeReason,
  IShapeListener, the reflected interface base IShapeComponent (world-space queries: AABBs, inside,
  distance to hull, ray, random point, contour, listeners), and two non-reflected optional halves reached
  through the shape itself - ISplineShape (GetSpline) and IShapeComponentEdit (GetEditInterface) - so no
  component inherits IEntityComponent twice. CBoxShapeComponent is the first implementation (local box
  with offset, Singleton, category "Area", aux-geom previewer).
- Code/Sandbox/Plugins/AreaComponentsEditor: Sandbox plugin skeleton with a stub CEditTool
  (EditTool.AreaShapeEdit) registered through REGISTER_CLASS_DESC; links EditorCommon only.
- Registered in Code/CryPlugins/CMakeLists.txt and Tools/CMake/BuildSandbox.cmake next to CinematicCamera.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
